<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westfield America yr net profit.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westfield America yr net profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    54.41</p>
<p>    Net				     26.61</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    4.24</p>
<p>    Sales				 137.38</p>
<p>    Other income			  1.31</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   4.24</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Westfield America floated in July 1996. It said the net profit was above the prospectus forecast of A$25.73 million.  </p>
<p>Dividend is nil franked</p>
<p>Pay Feb 28</p>
<p>Reg Feb 14</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
